{"track":"python","category":"함수 만들기 ① 기본","level":1,"title":"문자열 반복하기","desc":"<p>문자열 <code>s</code>를 <code>n</code>번 이어 붙인 문자열을 돌려주는 함수 <code>repeat_text(s, n)</code>을 만드세요.</p>","starter":"def repeat_text(s, n):\n    pass\n","solution":"def repeat_text(s, n):\n    return s * n\n","hint":"<p>문자열에 정수를 곱하면 반복돼요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"repeat_text(\"ab\", 3)","expected":"ababab","visible":true},{"call":"repeat_text(\"x\", 0)","expected":"","visible":true},{"call":"repeat_text(\"hi\", 1)","expected":"hi","visible":false},{"call":"repeat_text(\"\", 5)","expected":"","visible":false}],"id":"py-300"}